<title>UK: GOLDMAN SACHS SET CALLS ON DOUGLAS HOLDING.</title>
<headline>GOLDMAN SACHS SET CALLS ON DOUGLAS HOLDING.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said it has issued up to five million American-style call warrants, on Douglas Holding.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.  STRIKE PRICE    75 DEM		    PREMIUM	18.33 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.02 DEM		  GEARING	7.06 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.AUG.97-12.FEB.99   PAYDATE	19.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FFURT	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  72 DEM  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE     GSJP</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
